{"seq":2,"slug":"trade-facilitation","title":"贸易便利化：把时间从成本表里减掉","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/implementation-practice/trade-facilitation","wordCount":2304,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"贸易便利化-把时间从成本表里减掉\">贸易便利化：把时间从成本表里减掉</h1><p>关税战打了几十年，平均关税水平已经降到历史低位，但一件货物从义乌到华沙的账单里，比关税更重的项目其实是时间：等待通关的时间、滞留港口的时间、原产地证书在三个部门之间流转的时间。贸易便利化的全部要义，就是把这些以&quot;天&quot;计的成本翻译成可比较的价格，然后逐项消灭。本篇沿这条主线讨论制度、平台与归因三件事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[贸易便利化三层] --&gt; B[制度层&lt;br/&gt;规则与关税]&#10;    A --&gt; C[技术层&lt;br/&gt;通关与物流]&#10;    A --&gt; D[平台层&lt;br/&gt;电商与展会]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[RCEP 原产地累积]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[单一窗口 / AEO 互认]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;丝路电商 + 进博会&quot;]\">graph TB\n    A[贸易便利化三层] --&gt; B[制度层&lt;br/&gt;规则与关税]\n    A --&gt; C[技术层&lt;br/&gt;通关与物流]\n    A --&gt; D[平台层&lt;br/&gt;电商与展会]\n    B --&gt; B1[RCEP 原产地累积]\n    C --&gt; C1[单一窗口 / AEO 互认]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"丝路电商 + 进博会\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>核心机制</th>\n<th>可核查锚点</th>\n<th>度量方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>制度层</td>\n<td>自贸协定降税、累积规则</td>\n<td>RCEP 2022 年 1 月 1 日生效（15 国）</td>\n<td>关税等值下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术层</td>\n<td>单一窗口、AEO 互认</td>\n<td>海关总署通报的通关时间序列</td>\n<td>小时数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台层</td>\n<td>跨境电商、进口展会</td>\n<td>进博会 2018 年 11 月 5 日首届举办</td>\n<td>意向成交额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"时间的价格-通关效率的经济学\">时间的价格：通关效率的经济学</h2><p>时间为什么值钱？Hummels 与 Schaur 在 2013 年发表于《美国经济评论》的研究给出了被广泛引用的估计：货物在途每多一天，相当于约 0.6%–2.1% 的从价关税。其机理是库存资金占用、腐坏与过时风险、以及供应链响应迟缓造成的订单流失。把一天的时间成本记为从价税率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^{eq}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则一批价值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 的货物的便利化收益可以写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta C = t^{eq} \\cdot V \\cdot \\Delta d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是节省的天数。代入实际数字即可感受力度：中国海关总署通报显示，进口整体通关时间从 2017 年的约 97 小时压缩至 2022 年的三十余小时——按每省一天折合 0.6%–2.1% 关税换算，这相当于给全体进口商做了一轮普遍性减税，而且不损失一分钱财政收入。这一&quot;时间即关税&quot;的视角也回应了第一章<a href=\"../strategic-vision/five-connectivity\">五通</a>的框架问题：贸易畅通之所以必须排在设施联通之后，是因为引力方程里被压低的有效距离，最终都要通过通关与物流环节兑现为节省的天数。</p>\n<p>中欧班列是时间套利最直观的商业案例：2011 年 3 月 19 日首列&quot;渝新欧&quot;从重庆开往杜伊斯堡，全程约一万一千公里、运行十六天左右，把海运的四五周与空运的高价之间的空白地带变成了可用选项。2023 年全年开行约 1.7 万列（国铁集团口径），货物品类从早期笔电扩展到整车与冷链。班列的经济性边界同样清晰：单位成本高于海运、时效不及空运，它吃掉的是中间那一段对时间敏感、对成本敏感度次之的货流。</p>\n<p>班列的时间账里还藏着一项常被忽略的隐性成本：轨距换装。中国与欧洲采用 1435 毫米标准轨距，而哈萨克斯坦等独联体国家使用 1520 毫米宽轨，货物在阿拉山口—多斯特克等口岸必须换装或换转向架，单次耗时以小时计且构成拥堵瓶颈。这提醒便利化政策存在&quot;物理层残留&quot;——规则可以一夜统一，钢轨不行。口岸扩能改造（如阿拉山口站扩能）因此与通关改革同等重要，两者叠加才构成完整的时间压缩链条；通道本身的建设逻辑见<a href=\"infrastructure-projects\">基础设施项目</a>一篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"制度层-rcep-与累积规则\">制度层：RCEP 与累积规则</h2><p>区域全面经济伙伴关系协定（RCEP）2020 年 11 月 15 日签署、2022 年 1 月 1 日生效，覆盖 15 国、约占全球三成人口与经济总量。它对贸易畅通最有价值的创新是<strong>区域累积原产地规则</strong>：产品在各成员国间增值的部分可以累计算作本地成分，从而更容易达到享受关税优惠的原产地标准。用公式表达，某产品的区域价值含量为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>RCEP</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mtext>FOB</mtext></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RVC = \\frac{\\sum_{k \\in \\text{RCEP}} V_k}{\\text{FOB}} \\geq \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1531em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4671em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FOB</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7171em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">RCEP</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RVC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 越过协定门槛 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，整个区域的供应链都可以共享同一张优惠证书。这直接鼓励企业在区域内配置产业链而不是绕道——制度设计改变了工厂选址逻辑，这是比降税率更深的便利化。</p>\n<p>中国—东盟方向提供了长周期对照：双边贸易额从自贸区全面建成后的稳定增长，到东盟 2020 年成为中国第一大贸易伙伴；据中国海关总署数据，2023 年双边贸易额达 6.41 万亿元人民币（约 9100 余亿美元）。同期中国海关统计，2023 年对共建&quot;一带一路&quot;国家进出口占外贸总值的比重为 46.6%——这个数字的意义不在绝对值，而在于它说明倡议伙伴已构成中国外贸的基本盘而非补充。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台层-丝路电商与进博会的进口通道\">平台层：丝路电商与进博会的进口通道</h2><p>&quot;丝路电商&quot;机制截至 2023 年已与 30 个国家建立双边合作，其本质是把中国的电商平台、移动支付与海外仓体系向伙伴国开放接口——埃塞俄比亚的咖啡、智利的车厘子借直播与跨境物流直达中国消费者。中国国际进口博览会则从首届（2018 年 11 月 5 日）意向成交约 578 亿美元起步，到第六届（2023 年）升至约 784 亿美元，成为以国家展团背书的进口撮合平台。</p>\n<p>批评视角在这里必须进入：平台的繁荣有相当部分由中国的市场体量单独驱动，未必依赖倡议框架——没有&quot;丝路电商&quot;，车厘子照样会经一般贸易进关。倡议的真实增量在于降低中小贸易主体的接入门槛（政府间合作简化了检疫议定书与支付合规），以及为最不发达国家提供零关税展位这类再分配安排。把平台流量全部记在倡议名下，与后文的归因反模式同源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归因难题-如何估计倡议的贸易效应\">归因难题：如何估计倡议的贸易效应</h2><p>评估者真正想问的是反事实问题：签署合作文件的国家，其贸易增长有多少是倡议带来的？学术界的通行做法是在引力方程中加入虚拟变量或连通指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln T_{ij} = \\alpha + \\beta \\ln (Y_i Y_j) - \\gamma \\ln D_{ij} + \\delta\\, BRI_{ij} + \\varepsilon_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 就是倡议效应的估计值。但它的可信度取决于识别策略：若签约国本身就是与中国贸易增长最快的国家，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 会吸收选择性偏差而虚高。世界银行 2019 年报告选择结构模型路线，估算走廊交通项目全面落地可使走廊经济体间贸易增长 2.8%–9.7%，并明确标注这一估计的前提是配套改革到位。谨慎的结论应当是：倡议的贸易效应存在但高度异质，任何&quot;带动贸易 X 万亿美元&quot;的单点数字都应追问其识别策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式-把签约数当贸易创造\">反模式：把签约数当贸易创造</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>纠正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文件数崇拜</td>\n<td>以签署 200 多份合作文件证明贸易成效</td>\n<td>追踪到 HS 编码级的流量变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总量归因</td>\n<td>把对沿线贸易增长的总量全记给倡议</td>\n<td>用引力模型控制规模与距离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则幻觉</td>\n<td>认为签了 RCEP 就自动享受零关税</td>\n<td>检查原产地证书的实际利用率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台错配</td>\n<td>用进博会展台热度推断可持续订单</td>\n<td>追踪复购率与合同履约率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>原产地证书利用率是最容易被忽视的检验点：优惠协定生效不等于企业会用，申请证书的行政成本可能吞掉小额关税优惠。便利化政策的效果链条是&quot;规则—使用—流量&quot;三级，跳级庆祝是贸易数据最常见的造假式误读。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>时间是有价格的：每节省一天在途时间约合 0.6%–2.1% 从价关税（Hummels 与 Schaur, 2013），通关改革因此等价于普遍性减税</li>\n<li>中欧班列吃掉海运与空运之间的时间—成本空白带，2023 年单年开行约 1.7 万列，但其经济性有明确的货物类型边界</li>\n<li>RCEP 的区域累积规则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mtext>FOB</mtext></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RVC=\\frac{\\sum V_k}{\\text{FOB}}\\geq\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.355em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FOB</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 改变的是产业链选址逻辑，深度大于单纯降税</li>\n<li>2023 年对共建国家进出口占中国外贸总值 46.6%（海关总署），倡议伙伴已是基本盘</li>\n<li>引力方程中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BRI</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 变量系数存在选择性偏差风险；&quot;签约数当贸易创造&quot;与&quot;规则自动兑现&quot;是两个最需要警惕的反模式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"贸易便利化：把时间从成本表里减掉","id":"贸易便利化-把时间从成本表里减掉"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"时间的价格：通关效率的经济学","id":"时间的价格-通关效率的经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"制度层：RCEP 与累积规则","id":"制度层-rcep-与累积规则"},{"level":2,"text":"平台层：丝路电商与进博会的进口通道","id":"平台层-丝路电商与进博会的进口通道"},{"level":2,"text":"归因难题：如何估计倡议的贸易效应","id":"归因难题-如何估计倡议的贸易效应"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式：把签约数当贸易创造","id":"反模式-把签约数当贸易创造"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基础设施项目：从走廊骨架到项目账本","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/implementation-practice/infrastructure-projects"},"next":{"title":"金融合作：三层资金架构与债务方程","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/implementation-practice/financial-cooperation"}}